Handspell modified the original images by horizontal mirroring, extracted MediaPipe world
landmarks, normalized them to Handspell spec v1, and selected signer-balanced reference
exemplars. The alphabet and camera reference illustrations are derived from those landmarks.
The existing team-recorded A–D exemplars remain in the combined reference set.
The original images are not bundled with the app. No endorsement by the dataset creator is implied.
